{%- comment -%}
  Renders the mega menu panel (content ported from the live theme) for a top-level menu item.
  Outputs nothing when the item has no mega panel, so the default dropdown is used.

  Accepts:
  - handle: {String} Handleized top-level link title, e.g. 'headlamps' (required)

  Usage:
  {% render 'nav-mega-panel', handle: mega_handle %}
{%- endcomment -%}
